Vizco - Automated Financial Report Generation and Analysis

📌 Introduction

Vizco is an AI-powered solution designed to automate financial report generation and analysis, eliminating manual effort and improving accuracy. It integrates with popular accounting software to provide real-time insights and predictive analytics for better financial decision-making.

🛠️ Technologies Used

AI & Machine Learning – For anomaly detection and predictive analytics

Financial APIs – Integration with QuickBooks, SAP, and Tally

Blockchain – Ensuring regulatory compliance and data security

Data Visualization – Interactive dashboards for real-time financial insights

🎯 Features

✅ Automated Financial Report Generation – Eliminates manual effort

📊 Smart Data Extraction – Pulls data from accounting software

🔍 AI-Based Financial Analysis – Detects anomalies and predicts trends

📈 Interactive Dashboards – Real-time visual insights

⚖️ Regulatory Compliance – Adheres to IFRS, GAAP, and financial standards

🚀 Efficiency & Accuracy – Reduces errors and improves transparency

🚀 Installation & Setup

Clone the repository:

git clone https://github.com/your-username/vizco.git

Navigate to the project directory:

cd vizco

Install dependencies:

pip install -r requirements.txt  # For Python
npm install  # For Frontend

Run the application:

python main.py  # For backend
npm start  # For frontend

